{"id":"wb-8-156","name":"通天洞遗址","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"通天洞遗址","text":"通天洞遗址是位于中华人民共和国新疆维吾尔自治区阿勒泰地区吉木乃县托斯特乡阔依塔斯村东北的一处旧石器时代中、晚期，细石器时代，青铜时代至铁器时代早期的文化遗存。通天洞遗址是新疆境内发现的首个旧石器时代洞穴遗址。2019年10月7日，通天洞遗址被列入第八批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%80%9A%E5%A4%A9%E6%B4%9E%E9%81%97%E5%9D%80","revisionId":93611623,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93611623","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与所在地一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/bc5498e2d5142ac35f4d7d1a.jpg","title":"Tongtiandong_Site,_Altai,_2026.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Tongtiandong_Site,_Altai,_2026.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/da/Tongtiandong_Site%2C_Altai%2C_2026.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"User:CatOnMars","license":"CC BY 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0","caption":"​阿勒泰地区通天洞遗址","width":320,"height":240}}